{"title":"Chinese Mathematical Olympiad","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Chinese Mathematical Olympiad</b> (<b>CMO</b>, Chinese: <b>中国数学奥林匹克</b>) is an annual mathematics competition for high school students in China, organized by the Chinese Mathematical Society. It features teams from each province of mainland China, along with guest teams from the special administrative regions of Hong Kong and Macau, as well as from Russia and Singapore. The event plays a key role in selecting the Chinese team for the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=International_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"International Mathematical Olympiad\">International Mathematical Olympiad</a>.\n</p>\n<table style=\"border:thin solid black;padding:10px;float:right;margin:10px;background:#fff;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border:thin solid gray;text-align:center;background:#ccf;\"><b>Chinese Mathematical Olympiad</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Region</b>: China\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Type</b>: Proof\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Competition_ratings\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Competition ratings\">Difficulty</a></b>: 5.5 - 10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Difficulty Breakdown:</b>\n<p><u>Problem 1/4</u>: 6.5<br /><u>Problem 2/5</u>: 7.5-8<br /><u>Problem 3/6</u>: 9.5<br /><u>Problem SL1-2</u>: 5.5-7<br /><u>Problem SL3-4</u>: 7-8<br /><u>Problem SL5+</u>: 8-10\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chinese_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chinese_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Chinese MO Problems and Solutions\">Chinese MO Problems and Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=International_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"International Mathematical Olympiad\">International Mathematical Olympiad</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Competition_ratings\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Competition ratings\">AoPS Wiki:Competition ratings</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Chinese_Mathematical_Olympiad&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018040805\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 29/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 841/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 215/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.117      1 -total\n 55.01%    6.666      1 Template:Contest_Info\n 43.02%    5.213      1 Template:Stub\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:31304:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018040805 and revision id 245585. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}